# Normalise all text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Simon commits through SourceTree on Windows over \\wsl$, which has previously
# rewritten the entire tree to CRLF and produced a 100-file whitespace diff.
# eol=lf checks files out as LF on every platform, so that cannot recur.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
